---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — LeanReps"
  description="Privacy Policy for the LeanReps mobile application operated by Sourav Ganguly under Eodbytes. Learn how on-device camera processing and workout data are handled."
>
  <div style="background:#05070a;color:#F2F4F5;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;min-height:100vh;overflow-x:clip;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
    
    <!-- STICKY NAV -->
    <nav style="position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(11,14,17,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)">
      <div class="nav-inner" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <a href="/" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M52 68 L100 108 L148 60" stroke="#AAEC58" stroke-width="18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M52 108 L100 68 L148 108" stroke="#AAEC58" stroke-width="18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.55"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="140" x2="120" y2="140" stroke="#AAEC58" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85"/>
          </svg>
          <span style="font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1"><span style="color:#F2F4F5;font-weight:700">Lean</span><span style="color:#F2F4F5;font-weight:400;opacity:0.75">Reps</span></span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#AAEC58;text-decoration:none">
          <span>&larr;</span> Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
    <main style="flex:1;max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 32px 80px;width:100%">
      
      <!-- HERO HEADER -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:40px">
        <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(170,236,88,.12);border:1px solid rgba(170,236,88,.28);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AAEC58">
          Legal &amp; Privacy
        </div>
        <h1 style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em">
          Privacy Policy for LeanReps
        </h1>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#8b99b0;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif">
          Last Updated: August 20, 2026
        </div>
        <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(242,244,245,.75)">
          <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Sourav Ganguly</strong>, operating under <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Eodbytes</strong> ("we," "our," or "us"), operates the <strong style="color:#AAEC58">LeanReps</strong> mobile application. This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our Service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- SECTIONS CONTAINER -->
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">

        <!-- 1. Information Collection and Use -->
        <section style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border-radius:24px;padding:32px 30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:18px">01</span>
            Information Collection and Use
          </h2>
          <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
            While using LeanReps, we prioritize your privacy by processing data locally. We do not require account registration or any personal identification to use the app.
          </p>
          
          <div style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Camera and Video Data:</strong> We require access to your device's camera to count push-up repetitions, measure depth, and score elbow tuck and tempo. <strong style="color:#AAEC58">Important:</strong> All image and pose processing happens <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">locally on your device</strong>. We do not upload, store, stream, or share your photos or camera feed to the cloud or our servers.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">No Account Data:</strong> We do not collect names, email addresses, passwords, phone numbers, or social media profiles.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Usage &amp; Diagnostic Data:</strong> We may use <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Google Analytics for Firebase</strong> and <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Firebase Crashlytics</strong> to collect technical information on how the app is accessed (e.g., device model, OS version, performance metrics, and crash reports) to improve app stability and performance.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Service Providers -->
        <section style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border-radius:24px;padding:32px 30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:18px">02</span>
            Service Providers
          </h2>
          <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
            We employ third-party companies to facilitate our Service and provide infrastructure:
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Firebase Crashlytics / Analytics:</strong> Used to monitor and analyze the use of our Service, identify bugs, and improve the overall user experience.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Apple App Store &amp; Google Play Services:</strong> Used for basic app delivery, distribution, and security across supported mobile devices.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Data Retention and Deletion -->
        <section style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border-radius:24px;padding:32px 30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:18px">03</span>
            Data Retention and Deletion
          </h2>

          <div style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Retention:</strong> Since we do not collect personal identifiers or maintain user accounts, we do not retain your personal data in a central database.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">User Control:</strong> All workout history, session counts, and streak data are stored locally on your device. Deleting the app will remove any locally stored cached data.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:8px"></span>
              <div style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
                <strong style="color:#F2F4F5">Manual Requests:</strong> If you have concerns regarding technical logs collected by our analytics providers, you can contact us at <a href="mailto:eodbytes@gmail.com" style="color:#AAEC58;text-decoration:underline">eodbytes@gmail.com</a>.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Children’s Privacy -->
        <section style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border-radius:24px;padding:32px 30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:18px">04</span>
            Children’s Privacy
          </h2>
          <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
            Our Service does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and you are aware that your child has provided us with personal data, please contact us so that we will be able to take necessary actions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Changes to This Privacy Policy -->
        <section style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border-radius:24px;padding:32px 30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:18px">05</span>
            Changes to This Privacy Policy
          </h2>
          <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
            We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date at the top.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. Contact Us -->
        <section style="background:#AAEC58;color:#0B0E11;border-radius:24px;padding:34px 32px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -15px rgba(170,236,88,0.25)">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em">
            06. Contact Us
          </h2>
          <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:500;opacity:.85">
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:12px;background:#0B0E11;color:#AAEC58;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px">
            <span>By email:</span>
            <a href="mailto:eodbytes@gmail.com" style="color:#AAEC58;text-decoration:underline">eodbytes@gmail.com</a>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 32px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);width:100%">
      <div class="footer-inner" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M52 68 L100 108 L148 60" stroke="#AAEC58" stroke-width="18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M52 108 L100 68 L148 108" stroke="#AAEC58" stroke-width="18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.55"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="140" x2="120" y2="140" stroke="#AAEC58" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85"/>
          </svg>
          <span style="font-size:14px;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1"><span style="color:#F2F4F5;font-weight:700">Lean</span><span style="color:#F2F4F5;font-weight:400;opacity:0.75">Reps</span> <span style="color:#8b99b0;font-size:13px;margin-left:4px">&middot; Eodbytes</span></span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:26px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#8b99b0">
          <a href="/" style="color:#8b99b0;text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s ease">Home</a>
          <a href="/privacypolicy" style="color:#AAEC58;text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s ease">Privacy</a>
          <a href="mailto:eodbytes@gmail.com" style="color:#8b99b0;text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s ease">Support</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</Layout>
